model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, M2 G7 review N4: a projection's kept walk planned through 03-31, read again through 12-31 where a move first dated in June joins the plan (walk/fork.rs continue_planned disagreeing), then through 05-31 (meet_parked: planned past the read, freed)"

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
index month = month 2026-01..2026-12
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input pay: money PLN
input bonus: money PLN
input dlate: date

move salary[m in month]: transfers
  on start_of(m)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from world to konto amount pay

move late: transfers
  on dlate
  at dlate
  leg cash from world to konto amount bonus

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  pay = 100.00 PLN "s"
  bonus = 7.00 PLN "s"
  dlate = 2026-06-10 "s"
  opening[konto] = 50.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"

ask q1: bal(konto, 2026-03-31) from 2026-01-20, bal(konto, 2026-12-31) from 2026-01-20, bal(konto, 2026-05-31) from 2026-01-20
ask q2: bal(konto, 2026-03-31) from 2026-01-20
ask q3: bal(konto, 2026-12-31) from 2026-01-20
ask q4: min(bal(konto, d) from 2026-01-20 for d in 2026-01-20 .. 2026-12-31 step 1 day), bal(konto, 2026-06-30) from 2026-01-20
